      "id": "claim_7dfbcc0a42f14352a4174b0530fb4969",
      "statement": "The global config directory is resolved in order: QMD_CONFIG_DIR if set, then XDG_CONFIG_HOME/qmd if set, then qmdHomedir()/.config/qmd; the file read is <dir>/<indexName>.yml with default index name 'index'.",
