      "id": "claim_48039f4587064a72b578059d865359a4",
      "statement": "createStore syncs collections into SQLite in every mode it supports: with configPath it loads the YAML file and syncs it, with an inline config it syncs that object, and with neither it reuses existing store_collections rows; supplying both throws an error.",
